EDIT ... up to the sidecar timestamp for description and file_impact, ... carrying file_impact_scope / no_file_impact_reason alongside description/file_impact/children'.","src/rebar/reducer/_processors.py:399-405 `process_file_impact` sets state['file_impact'], state['file_impact_scope'], state['no_file_impact_reason'] — driven by a FILE_IMPACT event, not EDIT.","src/rebar/_commands/leaf.py:282-290 writes these fields via `append_event(resolved, 'FILE_IMPACT', data, ...)`; EDIT `fields` never carry file_impact (mine_outcome_corpus.py:258-260 `_edit_fields` reads data.fields, which are description/assignee/parent_id, not file_impact).","src/rebar/reducer/_version.py:96 lists FILE_IMPACT as a distinct KNOWN event type (folded into SNAPSHOTs during compaction, so at-review values must be recovered from FILE_IMPACT events / the nearest SNAPSHOT, not from EDIT).","material_diff.py:140,143 basis reads ctx.state.get('file_impact') and hashes file_impact_scope only when state['file_impact_scope']=='none' — both derive from FILE_IMPACT-sourced state."],"finding":"The reconstruction replays only CREATE/EDIT events, but file_impact / file_impact_scope / no_file_impact_reason are written exclusively by the separate FILE_IMPACT event type, so those material components are never rebuilt and the fingerprint recompute mismatches for any ticket with declared file impact.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f3ee8e13481aeeba2","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 2 ('replay CREATE/EDIT (tree + history-deleted) up to the sidecar timestamp for description and file_impact')","norm_id":"n30c01a8cdc9c4e4f","priority":1.0,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A reviewed ticket that ran `rebar file-impact` (declared paths) reconstructs with file_impact=[] and file_impact_scope='undeclared', so the recomputed fingerprint differs from material_fingerprint under every candidate and the row is spuriously marked unverified.","A ticket that declared no file impact (file_impact_scope=='none') cannot have its conditional basis component reconstructed — the plan's own 'file_impact_scope == none verified only once the conditional basis component is included' test fixture cannot pass as written."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"In step 2, add FILE_IMPACT to the replayed event set (tree + history-deleted), applying process_file_impact's LWW semantics (paths -> scope='paths'; file_impact_scope=='none' -> scope='none' with the raw reason; else 'undeclared') to populate ctx.state before recomputing the fingerprint; for compacted tickets fall back to the nearest SNAPSHOT.compiled_state for these fields.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"contradicts_reality","dod_uncertifiable":"certification_cannot_prove","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"moderate","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Specify how the children basis component is reconstructed for v1 sidecars (which lack reviewed_related_material) — e.g. replay parent_id relations from CREATE/EDIT history as of the sidecar timestamp — or document that childful v1 rows are expected-unverified.","coho